  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "NotImplemented ≠ NotImplementedError",
      "items": [
        "NotImplemented 是哨兵值：\"我不认识对方\"，触发反射回退",
        "NotImplementedError 是异常：\"子类必须实现\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "__eq__ 与 __hash__ 契约",
      "items": [
        "a == b 必须保证 hash(a) == hash(b)",
        "只定义 __eq__ 不定义 __hash__ → __hash__ = None，对象不可哈希"
      ]
    }
  ]
